    "fullBio": "I am a Counselling Psychologist dedicated to creating a non-judgmental, unhurried space for individuals traversing emotional fatigue, relationship distress, and personal growth. With over a year of active private practice under clinical supervision, my work integrates evidence-informed cognitive reflection with somatic grounding and person-centered warmth.",
